<title>ISRAEL: Dow in talks with Bromine group.</title>
<headline>Dow in talks with Bromine group.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>A senior delegation from Dow Chemical Co is in Israel to hold talks with Dead Sea Bromine Ltd, Bromine officials said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>They termed the visit very important but would not comment further. A spokesman for Israel Chemicals, Bromine's parent company, would not comment.</p>
<p>Newspaper reports said the two companies were discussing possible cooperation and exchange of know-how.</p>
<p>Bromine is one of the world's leading producers of bromine and bromine compounds.</p>
<p>- Jerusalem newsroom, 972-2-537-0502</p>
</text>
